0e/uploads/origins/89170844-c152-4f40-b0b1-d3bce12dc1d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d151b9fd07f28dc39761ecf57f2e3dd7, https://si.imgix.net/7b7f9d0e/uploads/origins/89170844-c152-4f40-b0b1-d3bce12dc1d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5e9ee02e2b41327cd7ebd42e36785e1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7b7f9d0e/uploads/origins/89170844-c152-4f40-b0b1-d3bce12dc1d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c7732cd5ddd4df2fed8cdcb9d085b30 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、\n\n以前、あなたからいただいたアートワークが大好きです！そして、このキャラクターのために、もう一度あなたから作品をいただけるとうれしいです：\n\n私のocは、角と長い巻き毛を持つ人間ではない女の子です。彼女の存在は人間の痛み、あるいは「痛み」という概念そのものである。テーマは「血と肉の花」「痛み」「心の虜」。自由に描いてください！また、服装はシンプルな方がいいなら、調整しても構いません。\n\n彼女の詳しい外見は添付のリンクにあります。\n\nこのリクエストを読んでいただき、本当にありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WvCC84lpiVWahpDmlE5elardOUwiE2Zt", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@1323_e/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37f82ea6/uploads/origins/2b154e4c-63b7-414e-a2a2-23387b2c2ccb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34b4dfa9f33a9cf549c83d5267c132e9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37f82ea6/uploads/origins/2b154e4c-63b7-414e-a2a2-23387b2c2ccb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34b4dfa9f33a9cf549c83d5267c132e9, https://si.imgix.net/37f82ea6/uploads/origins/2b154e4c-63b7-414e-a2a2-23387b2c2ccb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7454f088f5c62e9b5a8fcdebf04c21c8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37f82ea6/uploads/origins/2b154e4c-63b7-414e-a2a2-23387b2c2ccb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6921ec74ab6739700212ec02bf54309e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Sensei! I really like your art work! Your style looks stunning and I would love to request you to illustrate a commission for my original character! \n\nName: 宗樺\nAge: 24\neye colour: really light pink-red on the outside, with the middle a stronger red, and the pupil is tiny, like a leopard (No highlight on eye please!)\nHe has sharp canine teeth\n\nOutfit: If possible, can you please draw him in his Half dragon form (under the file named \"half dragon form\"）? if this request makes you feel uncomfortable, please feel free to change to his human form as well!\n\nPlease add his black ribbon earring on his left ear (very long, can reach his shoulder) as his symbol. Other part of the outfit can be change depending on your preference!  \n\nPersonality: \nHe always pretend to be nice and kind to the public, but in fact he is utterly evil, exceptionally cruel and ruthless.  He is a highly intelligent sociopath with a strong desire for control and hates situations spiraling out of his grasp. No one ever truly knows what he is thinking. \n\nThank you very much for reading my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DtAWHKiIIu2VKpSaeUlYTzHsQ2ppyO2w?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@1323_e/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf5f5385/uploads/origins/03ed695a-73d4-42e4-b87c-15316aba3536?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3744ca8e0a5ee3e1d8f7c006cd18a361", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf5f5385/uploads/origins/03ed695a-73d4-42e4-b87c-15316aba3536?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3744ca8e0a5ee3e1d8f7c006cd18a361, https://si.imgix.net/bf5f5385/uploads/origins/03ed695a-73d4-42e4-b87c-15316aba3536?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21b076277f4114f566389ac797249db5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf5f5385/uploads/origins/03ed695a-73d4-42e4-b87c-15316aba3536?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=913d7cfc691d0fbde638dd2db130bcb4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Eめる先生、こんにちは！先生の絵柄がとても好きです！深くて幻想的な雰囲気が本当に美しくて感動しました。\nどうぞご自由に描いてください！\n\nOCの設定について：\n\n正体：死神の血を引く妖怪\n\n外見：身長155cm、見た目年齢は13歳くらい、生まれてからまだ4ヶ月\n\n性格：静かで冷淡、人間ではない存在\n\n彼女は人間や自分自身の感情をよく理解していません\n\n特徴：\n\n緑色のリボン（額にあり、非常に重要な特徴）\n\n宝石のような緑の瞳\n\nきれいに揃った前髪\n\n狐のように大きくてふわふわした耳と尻尾\n\n彼女のそばには、常に青い幽霊の友達がいます。幽霊には三つの異なる姿があり、どれを描いていただいても構いません。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-XOPnXbWtSkx9tJyYjEaoYUPV9HZcX-O?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@1323_e/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bda98a2a/uploads/origins/0f0fc1b8-c2ad-4667-a089-beec1a92a36a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=734c005260cc61d5dc2998eccc5d0a5d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bda98a2a/uploads/origins/0f0fc1b8-c2ad-4667-a089-beec1a92a36a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=734c005260cc61d5dc2998eccc5d0a5d, https://si.imgix.net/bda98a2a/uploads/origins/0f0fc1b8-c2ad-4667-a089-beec1a92a36a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c05fa35931fa7d80a7e885e9859161f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bda98a2a/uploads/origins/0f0fc1b8-c2ad-4667-a089-beec1a92a36a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=34709bbeff616e5b8481db97120108d2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@1323_e/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ff30b074/uploads/origins/58c36f73-c03c-42a0-a2c8-d72cdc8a75f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=529a0a43cf94fdb8217c14184d78ae23", "thumbnail_sr